{"version":"V28.32-scheme-reorder-btns","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T06:00:00.000Z","note":"V28.32 Semi-transparent ▲/▼ reorder buttons directly on the GOST schematic, next to each input apparatus, so the sequence of the input automatics can be changed right on the diagram (in addition to the form's ◀▶ and drag). Tapping a button swaps that apparatus with its neighbour and redraws. Buttons are gated to the input chain; the first has only ▼ and the last only ▲. Tapping a button never starts a block-drag."}
